# 打包产物：根目录遗留的旧版可执行文件（构建输出，不入库）
/codework-codex-plus-plus.exe
/codework-codex-plus-plus-manager.exe

# 发布资产：安装包与历史版本清单快照
# 安装包体积大（每个约 17 MB）且可由 scripts/build-codework-windows.ps1 重新产出
release-assets/*.exe
release-assets/*.zip
release-assets/codework-skills/*.zip
# 历史版本的清单与发布说明快照（形如 -1.3.42.json / -1.3.42-notes.json）
# 生效清单 codework-ai-client-windows.json 与 codework-ai-client-windows-v2.json 不在此列，必须入库
release-assets/codework-ai-client-[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*-notes.json
release-assets/codework-ai-client-windows-[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json
release-assets/codework-ai-client-windows-[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*-notes.json
release-assets/CodeworkAI客户端-[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*更新说明.md
release-assets/CodeworkAI客户端-[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*使用小贴士.md

# 私钥类文件绝不入库
*release-private*
*.private.key
*-private.key

